          </span>
          <p class="card__index">Swarm</p>
          <h3 class="card__title">Hivemind</h3>
          <p class="card__body">
            A fleet of small quadcopters flying as one. Every drone runs the
            same controller and negotiates its own role, so the formation
            survives losing a member mid-flight.
          </p>
          <div class="card__spacer"></div>
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/projects.html#hivemind">Read more</a>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <span class="card__icon">
            <span class="icon icon--fold icon--lg" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </span>
          <p class="card__index">Folding &amp; throwable</p>
          <h3 class="card__title">Origami</h3>
          <p class="card__body">
            A drone that folds to the size of a paperback, gets thrown into
            the air, and unfolds mid-flight to run small jobs around a
            house.
          </p>
          <div class="card__spacer"></div>
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/projects.html#origami">Read more</a>
        </article>

        <article class="card reveal">
          <span class="card__icon">
            <span class="icon icon--vtol icon--lg" aria-hidden="true"
            ></span>
          </span>
          <p class="card__index">VTOL</p>
          <h3 class="card__title">Peregrine</h3>
          <p class="card__body">
            A tail-sitter that lifts off straight up like a quadcopter, tips
            over onto a fixed wing, and cruises. The hard part is the
            handover.
          </p>
          <div class="card__spacer"></div>
          <a class="link-arrow" href="/projects.html#peregrine">Read more</a>
        </article>
